            "review_text": "IntanNurSuhana@SEU338E\nPenang Island, Malaysia25 contributions\n0\nRare Halal Food in Hanoi\nMay 2020\nIt is a small restaurant just beside the mosque. Easy to find because it is within the walking distance from city center. nice food and coffee. Price wise was quite on the expensive side for local cuisine but since it was hard to find halal food, the price was justified.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 14, 2021",
