            "review_title": "Review at Zaynab Restaurant",
            "review_text": "ashrafazrol\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia136 contributions\n0\nGood Halal Food.\nDec 2019\nThere is a small halal restaurant just beside the mosque. Its entrance is not facing the main street. Find where they park motorbikes, and you will find the Zynab restaurant entrance. There are about 4 tables. It opens at 11 am. Come early, eat and quickly make space for others.\n\nThe food is good. A wide selection of Western, Arabic and local Vietnamese-style foods. The price range is between 100-250k dong.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 2, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
